@format 1
@id application.startup
@title Application startup
@area Application
@entry input
@summary Initialize shared services, restore persisted state, recover work, and show the main window.
@flow TB
@related project.restore-session, relay.receive-tab, queue.recover-stale
@tag startup
@tag restore

@alias app = Cadroue.UIShell.PProgram
@alias preference = Cadroue.UIShell.LPreference
@alias scene = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LScene
@alias schedule = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LSchedule

[input] Process startup <input>
- Receive the WPF startup event @ app.OnStartup(...)
- Read an optional relayed-tab payload @ app.LRelayStartupRead(...)
> restore

[restore] Restore persisted configuration <process>
- Load renderer settings @ app.OnStartup(...)
- Load and normalize preferences @ preference.LPreferenceLoad(...)
- Load the current scene @ scene.LSceneCurrentLoad(...)
- Load localization and shortcut state @ app.OnStartup(...)
> services

[services] Prepare workspace and services <decision>
- Attempt to apply the workspace and sidecar roots @ app.LDepotRootApply(...)
? "Workspace preparation succeeds or no root change is required" > connect
? "Workspace preparation fails and is logged" > connect

[connect] Establish remaining application services <process>
- Connect stations to the shared schedule @ app.LStationSeamApply(...)
- Connect runner reporting to the logging system @ app.OnStartup(...)
> recover

[recover] Recover interrupted work <process>
- Resolve stale running claims @ app.LScheduleRecoverRun(...)
- Start the relay channel and preview engine @ app.OnStartup(...)
> window

[window] Show the application <output>
- Create and show the main window @ app.OnStartup(...)
= Startup continues even when workspace preparation failed; its dependent workspace/sidecar state may be unavailable or still point to an earlier root.
